  note      = {Open source release of Apple's corecrypto library
               including C code, ARM64 assembly, and Isabelle/HOL
               formal verification theories. Kelvin studies this
               release for proof structure patterns (e.g., polynomial
               addition loops vs. abstract map operations in Isabelle)
               to structure its own Kani proofs for orbital force
               calculations.}
}

